<title>BELGIUM: TENNIS-KUERTEN BEATS DEWULF IN FRENCH OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-KUERTEN BEATS DEWULF IN FRENCH OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian Gustavo Kuerten beat Belgian Filip Dewulf 6-1 3-6 6-1 7-6 (7-4) in the semifinals of the French Open on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
